rust-proxmox-installer-types (0.3.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * implement AsRef<FqdnConfig> for FqdnConfigContainer, simplifying
    matching on it.

  * use the MacAddress type for the MAC addresses in the interface name
    pinning map of the answer and in the network interface info of the
    post-hook data. This is a breaking change.

  * answer: add options for setting up a bond for the management
    interface, with its members given by MAC address or selected by a
    filter on udev properties.

  * answer: add option for setting the VLAN tag of the management network,
    for static network configurations.

  * fetch: report schema version 1.1 in the answer fetch data, as installers
    built with this version accept the bond and VLAN answer options, and add
    helpers to compare it with the schema version an answer requires.

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:06:49 +0200

